<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31613" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκάτη</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκᾰτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Hecate,</i> lit. <i>she who works her will,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				411
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				25
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				955
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑ. φωσφόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					594a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				968
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκατος.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκάτης δεῖπνον</span>
			<i>Hecate's</i> dinner, a meal set out by rich persons at the foot
			of her statue <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τριόδοις</span> on the
				<i><span class="en">
				30t
			</span></i>h day of each month, when it became a sort of dole for
			beggars and paupers, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				594
			</span></i> et Sch. adloc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.280c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				290d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				247
			</span></i> : hence, as it consisted of offal, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκαταῖα κατεσθίειν,</span> of a rapscallion, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				54.39
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>.</div>
